# HT2, written by hand from the contract: chunk c at f_c, MAC(i,j,k) in cycle f_c + (k - c*Kt) + i + j;
# cells 00 01 10 11; last MAC 3+2+2+2-3 = 6; drain [7,9) row 1 then row 0.
0 mac 0 . . . drain -
1 mac 1 0 0 . drain -
2 mac . 1 1 0 drain -
3 mac 2 . . 1 drain -
4 mac 3 2 2 . drain -
5 mac . 3 3 2 drain -
6 mac . . . 3 drain -
7 mac . . . . drain 1
8 mac . . . . drain 0
